#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""v6: live-execution hardening for the NIFTY intraday options engine.

Run `python3 patch_v6.py` (optionally: `python3 patch_v6.py /path/to/repo`)
against a pristine checkout or one that already carries patch_v5.py. Every
change is confined to the live path: UpstoxClient transport and order
lifecycle, the live order executor, the kill switch, the square-off
watchdog and the operator alert. The backtest path, the fill model, the
signal pipeline and every tuned threshold are untouched, so replay P&L is
unchanged by construction and verified to be so (1,047 / 1,133 / 1,800 /
+5,924 for 2026-09-08..11).

All-or-nothing: hunks are staged in memory, compiled and hash-checked, and
the tree is reverted if anything fails. Re-running is a no-op.

Exit codes: 0 applied or already up to date, 2 wrong directory,
3 anchor drift (nothing modified), 4 compile failure (reverted).
"""
